==Description==
The '''Chicken Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained at Level 23 of the regular [[Spring Frenzy Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{Bunz|1,450}} or {{Robux|76}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{Bunz|8,210}} or {{Robux|1,852}}.

The '''Chicken Nametag''' has light yellow text with a bright yellow outline. Eggs, white feathers and orange [[wp:Onomatopoeia|onomatopoeia]] emit from the text. Dark brown smoke is seen behind the text.

